.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt PCI_REQUEST_REGION 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm pci_request_region
.Nd reserve the address range described by a PCI BAR
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/pci.h
.Ft int
.Fn pci_request_region "pci_device_t *dev" "int bar" "const char *name"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn pci_request_region
function reserves the I/O or MMIO range described by the selected PCI BAR
using the generic resource manager.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 0 on success and -1 on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pci_bar 9 ,
.Xr request_region 9 ,
.Xr request_mem_region 9
